{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05838","headline":"赠祖三咏 · 王维","name":"赠祖三咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蟏蛸挂虚牖，蟋蟀鸣前除。\n岁晏凉风至，君子复何如。\n高馆阒无人，离居不可道。\n闲门寂已闭，落日照秋草。\n虽有近音信，千里阻河关。\n中复客汝颍，去年归旧山。\n结交二十载，不得一日展。\n贫病子既深，契阔余不浅。\n仲秋虽未归，暮秋以爲期。\n良会讵几日，终日长相思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05838.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05838","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}